==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|frm|harassement}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# Persistent attacks and criticism causing [[worry]] and [[distress]].
# Deliberate [[pestering]] or [[annoying]].
# Excessive [[intimidation]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|torment}}
* {{l|en|molestation}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|verbal harassment}}
* {{l|en|workplace harassment}}
* {{l|en|sexual harassment}}

